...
══ Failed tests ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
── Error (test_load_10X.R:37:3): 10x Spatial Data Parsing ──────────────────────
Error: object 'txsp' not found
Backtrace:
    █
 1. └─testthat::expect_is(txsp, "Seurat") test_load_10X.R:37:2
 2.   └─testthat::quasi_label(enquo(object), label, arg = "object")
